{"id":"juzgado","lemma":"juzgado","pos":"noun","rank":2498,"glosses":["a court of law with a judge","a place for adjudicated individuals","judicate (e.g., the Sardinian judicates), judgedom, judicature"],"ipa":"/xuθˈɡado/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"juzgados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-juzgado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Te he juzgado demasiado rápido.","en":"I judged you too quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801423","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"too much"},{"g":"rapid"}]},{"text":"Te he juzgado mal.","en":"I've misjudged you.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"}]}]}